<LanguageData>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter1.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameDef], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has contacted us with news of a long-lost starship. Generations ago, a legendary vessel belonging to a nomadic warrior fleet crashed on this planet, its crew renowned for wielding cryptoparticles in battle. The cryptoforge ship shattered upon atmospheric entry, breaking into three massive fragments scattered across the surface. To locate them, we must reactivate an ancient scanning relay station. \n\n[asker_nameDef] says that initiating the scans will allow us to pinpoint the locations of the ship’s stern and bow, which may hold further clues to the whereabouts of the final, most crucial fragment. However, the relay station remains heavily secured - automated turrets still stand watch, and the surrounding grounds are riddled with a dense minefield. Worse yet, the power surge from the scan is certain to draw the attention of nearby mechanoids.\n\nComplete the scans on both relays to discover the location of the ship fragments.-->
    <li>[asker_faction_name] 的 questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameDef]、[asker_faction_leaderTitle] 与我们联系，报告了一艘失踪已久的星舰的消息。几代人以前，一艘属于游牧战士舰队的传奇船只在这个星球上坠毁，其船员因在战斗中使用加密粒子而闻名。加密铸造船在进入大气层时破碎，分成三块巨大的碎片，散落在地表。为了找到它们，我们必须重新激活一个古老的扫描中继站。 

[asker_nameDef]表示，启动扫描将使我们能够查明船尾和船头的位置，这可能会为最终、最关键的碎片的下落提供进一步的线索。然而，中继站仍然戒备森严——自动化炮塔仍然严阵以待，周围的地面布满了密集的雷区。更糟糕的是，扫描产生的电涌肯定会引起附近机械体的注意。

完成两个继电器上的扫描，以发现船舶碎片的位置。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->We've uncovered information about a long-lost starship. Generations ago, a legendary vessel belonging to a nomadic warrior fleet crashed on this planet, its crew renowned for wielding cryptoparticles in battle. The cryptoforge ship shattered upon atmospheric entry, breaking into three massive fragments scattered across the surface. To locate them, we must reactivate an ancient scanning relay station. \n\nInitiating the scans will allow us to pinpoint the locations of the ship’s stern and bow, which may hold further clues to the whereabouts of the final, most crucial fragment. However, the relay station remains heavily secured - automated turrets still stand watch, and the surrounding grounds are riddled with a dense minefield. Worse yet, the power surge from the scan is certain to draw the attention of nearby mechanoids.\n\nComplete the scans on both relays to discover the location of the ship fragments.-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;我们发现了一艘失踪已久的星舰的信息。几代人以前，一艘属于游牧战士舰队的传奇船只在这个星球上坠毁，其船员因在战斗中使用加密粒子而闻名。加密铸造船在进入大气层时破碎，分成三块巨大的碎片，散落在地表。为了找到它们，我们必须重新激活一个古老的扫描中继站。 

启动扫描将使我们能够查明船尾和船头的位置，这可能会为最终、最关键的碎片的下落提供进一步的线索。然而，中继站仍然戒备森严——自动化炮塔仍然严阵以待，周围的地面布满了密集的雷区。更糟糕的是，扫描产生的电涌肯定会引起附近机械体的注意。

完成两个继电器上的扫描，以发现船舶碎片的位置。</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter1.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter1.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Scanning for the Cryptoforge-->
    <li>questName-&gt;扫描 Cryptoforge</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter1.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter2.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->Data retrieved from the ancient relay station confirms the crash site of the cryptoforge ship’s stern, located not far from the scanning facility. While this section does not contain the legendary cryptoforge itself, it holds a crucial black box. To pinpoint the final cryptoforge fragment, we must retrieve its data and pair it with the bow’s black box records. \n\nThe wreckage scan reveals a high concentration of dormant mechanoids aboard, making conflict likely. The ship’s hull is built from near-indestructible material, limiting possible entry points. Ancient airlocks might still be operational, though forcing them open will require effort. Some external turrets remain active, further complicating the approach. Inside, automated floor freezers keep the corridors at dangerously low temperatures, serving as a defensive measure against intruders. \n\nDespite these challenges, the wreckage contains valuable resources. Extracting as much salvage as possible will be essential for reactivating the cryptoforge and crafting the legendary cryptogear.\n\nAccording to the scan, the ship is protected by at least:\n[ListOfEnemies]-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;从古代中继站检索到的数据证实了加密锻造船船尾的坠毁地点，距离扫描设施不远。虽然本部分不包含传奇的 cryptoforge 本身，但它包含一个至关重要的黑匣子。为了精确定位最终的 cryptoforge 片段，我们必须检索其数据并将其与弓的黑匣子记录配对。 

残骸扫描显示船上有高度集中的休眠机械体，很可能发生冲突。该船的船体由几乎坚不可摧的材料制成，限制了可能的进入点。古老的气闸可能仍然可以使用，尽管强行打开它们需要付出努力。一些外部炮塔仍然处于活动状态，使方法进一步复杂化。在内部，自动落地冰柜将走廊保持在危险的低温下，作为抵御入侵者的防御措施。 

尽管面临这些挑战，残骸中仍然蕴藏着宝贵的资源。提取尽可能多的废品对于重新激活加密铸造厂和制作传奇的加密齿轮至关重要。

根据扫描，该船至少受到以下保护：
[ListOfEnemies]</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter2.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter2.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Cryptoforge stern-->
    <li>questName-&gt;Cryptoforge 船尾</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter2.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter3.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->Data recovered from the ancient relay station has revealed the crash site of the cryptoforge ship’s bow, located not far from the scanning relay’s position. While this section does not house the cryptoforge itself, it contains a vital black box. To locate the final ship fragment, we must retrieve its data and pair it with the information from the stern’s black box. \n\nScans indicate a significant presence of insectoid lifeforms infesting the wreckage, making combat inevitable if we wish to reach the bridge where the black box is stored. The ship’s hull is composed of nearly indestructible material, limiting our means of entry. Some ancient airlocks may still function, but forcing them open will be necessary. A weak energy signature has also been detected within - likely from a dormant reactor. If reactivated, it may power the ship’s old floor heaters, weakening the cold-adapted insectoids inside.\n\nAlthough the cryptoforge itself is not housed within this wreckage, valuable resources remain, fused and reshaped by the ship’s violent descent. Extracting these materials will aid in restoring the cryptoforge and crafting the legendary cryptogear. Studying the black box should be our top priority.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;从古代中继站恢复的数据显示了加密锻造船船头的坠毁地点，距离扫描中继站的位置不远。虽然该部分不包含 cryptoforge 本身，但它包含一个重要的黑匣子。为了找到最终的船舶碎片，我们必须检索其数据并将其与船尾黑匣子中的信息配对。 

扫描表明残骸中大量存在类昆虫生命体，如果我们想到达存放黑匣子的桥梁，战斗就不可避免。船体由几乎坚不可摧的材料组成，限制了我们的进入方式。一些古老的气闸可能仍然有效，但有必要强行打开它们。内部也检测到了微弱的能量信号——可能来自休眠反应堆。如果重新激活，它可能会为船上的旧地板加热器提供动力，从而削弱内部适应寒冷的昆虫。

尽管加密熔炉本身并不位于此残骸中，但宝贵的资源仍然存在，并因船舶的剧烈下降而融合和重塑。提取这些材料将有助于恢复加密熔炉并制作传奇的加密装备。研究黑匣子应该是我们的首要任务。</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter3.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter3.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Cryptoforge bow-->
    <li>questName-&gt;Cryptoforge 弓</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter3.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter4.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->After analyzing the data from both black boxes, we have finally pinpointed the location of the last ship fragment - home to the legendary cryptoforge. This ancient ultratech workshop contains the lost knowledge and equipment necessary to craft cryptogear, a technology long thought to be impossible to recreate by any other means. This is our only chance to forge such items, so we must bring our best crafters and as many resources as possible.\n\nThe cryptoforge requires an immense amount of power to function, but the crash site still contains a dormant cryptogenerator. While it survived the descent, it only has enough fuel to run for 48 hours. Once activated, it will begin a countdown to meltdown, wiping the entire fragment from the planet’s surface, along with the cryptoforge. This limited time frame means we must work quickly, crafting as much cryptogear as possible before the generator’s collapse. Enabling the cryptogenerator will also reactivate the ship’s ancient defensive turrets, providing much-needed protection against the mechanoids that will inevitably arrive, drawn to the massive energy surge.\n\nBeyond the cryptoforge, the ship’s interior appears remarkably intact. The sealed structure has preserved valuable resources, food, and medicine, as well as functional sleeping quarters, a recreation area, and other remnants of cryptoforge technology. The environment will still be harsh, but the cryptogenerator will power the ship’s heaters and lights, making the space more suitable for extended work. One cryptosleep casket remains occupied, whoever is inside has been frozen for centuries. Freeing them could prove useful, though it is not essential to our mission.\n\nThis is our one and only opportunity. Once the generator melts down, the cryptoforge and its secrets will be lost forever. We must establish a strong defense, make the most of our limited time, and craft as much legendary cryptogear as possible before the clock runs out.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;分析了两个黑匣子的数据后，我们终于查明了最后一块船碎片的位置——传说中的加密铸造厂的所在地。这个古老的超技术车间包含失落的知识和制造加密装备所需的设备，长期以来人们认为这种技术无法通过任何其他方式重新创造。这是我们锻造此类物品的唯一机会，因此我们必须带上最好的工匠和尽可能多的资源。

加密铸造厂需要大量的电力才能运行，但崩溃站点仍然包含一个休眠的加密发生器。虽然它在下降过程中幸存下来，但它的燃料只够运行 48 小时。一旦激活，它将开始熔化倒计时，从行星表面抹去整个碎片以及加密熔炉。有限的时间意味着我们必须快速工作，在发电机崩溃之前制造出尽可能多的加密装备。启用密码生成器还将重新激活飞船古老的防御炮塔，提供急需的保护，防止不可避免地到来的、被巨大能量激增所吸引的机械人。

在密码铸造之外，飞船的内部看起来非常完好。这个密封的结构保存了宝贵的资源、食物和药品，以及功能性的睡眠区、休闲区和其他加密技术的残余物。环境仍然很恶劣，但加密发电机将为船上的加热器和灯供电，使该空间更适合长时间工作。一个加密睡眠棺材仍然被占用，里面的人都已经被冰冻了几个世纪。释放他们可能会很有用，尽管这对于我们的任务来说并不是必需的。

这是我们唯一的机会。一旦发电机熔化，加密铸造厂及其秘密将丢失永远。我们必须建立强大的防御，充分利用有限的时间，在时间耗尽之前制造尽可能多的传奇加密装备。</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter4.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter4.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Legendary cryptoforge-->
    <li>questName-&gt;传奇的加密铸造</li>
  </VQE_Cryptoforge_Chapter4.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
</LanguageData>
